130	            "NSW", "Australia/Sydney", "VIC", "Australia/Melbourne", "QLD", "Australia/Brisbane");
131	
132	    /**
133	     * Derives the owner's {@code timezone} (IANA name) from the {@link #locality(Owner)
134	     * locality}/region via the fixed region-to-timezone table (NSW->Australia/Sydney,
135	     * VIC->Australia/Melbourne, QLD->Australia/Brisbane). Returns {@code null} when the
136	     * region is not in the table (e.g. an {@code UNKNOWN} locality), so such owners have
137	     * no timezone.
138	     */
139	    protected String timezone(Owner owner) {
140	        return REGION_TIMEZONE.get(locality(owner));
141	    }
142	
143	    /**
144	     * Builds the membership number '<customerCode>-M<YY>', where YY is the last two digits of
145	     * the registrationDate year (e.g. 'NSW-1A2B3C4D-M26'). Returns {@code null} when either the
146	     * customer code or the registration date is absent (e.g. legacy seed owners).
147	     */
148	    protected String membershipNumber(Owner owner) {
149	        if (owner.getCustomerCode() == null || owner.getRegistrationDate() == null) {
150	            return null;
151	        }
152	        return String.format("%s-M%02d", owner.getCustomerCode(), owner.getRegistrationDate().getYear() % 100);
153	    }
154	
155	    /**
156	     * True when more than {@value #BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD} other owners have already
157	     * been created for this owner's {@code registrationDate}, using the same per-day
158	     * accumulation the daily create limit enforces (the owner itself is excluded). Returns
159	     * {@code false} when the owner has no registration date (e.g. legacy seed owners).
160	     */
161	    protected boolean bulkSignupWarning(Owner owner) {
162	        LocalDate registrationDate = owner.getRegistrationDate();
163	        if (registrationDate == null) {
164	            return false;
165	        }
166	        long count = ownerRepository.findAll().stream()
167	                .filter(existing -> !existing.getId().equals(owner.getId()))
168	                .filter(existing -> registrationDate.equals(existing.getRegistrationDate()))
169	                .count();
170	        return count > BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD;
171	    }
172	
173	    /**
174	     * The Luhn check digit (0-9) computed over the digits contained in the owner's
175	     * {@code customerCode}. Returns {@code null} when the customer code is absent (e.g.
176	     * legacy seed owners).
177	     */
178	    protected Integer checkDigit(Owner owner) {
179	        String customerCode = owner.getCustomerCode();
180	        if (customerCode == null) {
181	            return null;
182	        }
183	        int sum = 0;
184	        boolean dbl = true;
185	        for (int i = customerCode.length() - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
186	            char c = customerCode.charAt(i);
187	            if (c < '0' || c > '9') {
188	                continue;
189	            }
190	            int d = c - '0';
191	            if (dbl) {
192	                d *= 2;
193	                if (d > 9) {
194	                    d -= 9;
195	                }
196	            }
197	            sum += d;
198	            dbl = !dbl;
199	        }
200	        return (10 - (sum % 10)) % 10;
201	    }
202	
203	    public abstract Owner toOwner(OwnerDto ownerDto);
204	
205	    @Mapping(target = "id", ignore = true)
206	    @Mapping(target = "pets", ignore = true)
207	    public abstract Owner toOwner(OwnerFieldsDto ownerDto);
208	
209	    public abstract List<OwnerDto> toOwnerDtoCollection(Collection<Owner> ownerCollection);
210	
211	    public abstract Collection<Owner> toOwners(Collection<OwnerDto> ownerDtos);
212	
213	    public OwnerPageDto toOwnerPageDto(@NonNull Page<Owner> ownerPage) {
214	        OwnerPageDto ownerPageDto = new OwnerPageDto();
215	        ownerPageDto.setContent(toOwnerDtoCollection(ownerPage.getContent()));
216	        ownerPageDto.setPage(ownerPage.getNumber());
217	        ownerPageDto.setSize(ownerPage.getSize());
218	        ownerPageDto.setTotalElements(ownerPage.getTotalElements());
219	        ownerPageDto.setTotalPages(ownerPage.getTotalPages());
220	        return ownerPageDto;
221	    }
222	}
